# PX4 v1.17 partial QGC overlay for a REAL Quad-X UAV (SYS_HITL=0).
# Candidate slow movement limits only; they were validated on the 2.0893 kg X500 model,
# NOT on this approximately 5-6 kg, 6S, 3120-700 kV aircraft. No real flight validation.
# Import only after restoring/checking the real airframe, outputs, sensors and calibrations.
# SYS_AUTOSTART=4001 is the pre-reset generic Quad-X airframe observed on this Pixhawk;
# verify it matches the frame before importing. Reboot after import.
# TELEM2 assumes TX/RX/GND at 921600; FLOW_CTRL=0. COM_RC_IN_MODE=3 allows RC/joystick.
# HIL outputs and safety-check breakers are cleared explicitly on return from HITL.
# No X500 hover/PID, HIL bypass, or HITL offboard-loss action is transferred.
# A 6S cell count is supplied, but battery monitor/voltage/current scaling need setup.
# This is not a ready-to-fly or complete post-reset configuration.
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
1	1	SYS_AUTOSTART	4001	6
1	1	SYS_HITL	0	6
1	1	MAV_1_CONFIG	102	6
1	1	MAV_1_MODE	2	6
1	1	MAV_1_FLOW_CTRL	0	6
1	1	MAV_1_FORWARD	0	6
1	1	MAV_1_RATE	0	6
1	1	SER_TEL2_BAUD	921600	6
1	1	COM_RC_IN_MODE	3	6
1	1	CA_ROTOR_COUNT	4	6
1	1	HIL_ACT_FUNC1	0	6
